WEBVTT

00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:30.601
There's nothing that makes them concede.

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:34.768
It's just a norm in a year
in which nothing is normal.

00:04:34.792 --> 00:04:39.268
So what if a losing candidate
simply refuses to concede?

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:41.643
What if there is no concession speech?

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:44.893
Well, what could happen might terrify you.

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.184
I think it should.

00:04:46.208 --> 00:04:47.849
First, to give you 
the background,

00:04:47.863 --> 00:04:49.717
let's make sure
we're on the same page,

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:51.309
let me give you this analogy.

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:55.059
Think about a presidential election
as a baseball game.

00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:56.434
The end of the ninth inning,

00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:59.476
whoever is ahead wins,
whoever is behind loses.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.768
That's baseball.